meta {
  name: Lumina API
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  Local Bruno collection for the Lumina Express API.

  1. Open the Lumina workspace (workspace.yml) in Bruno, or open this folder as a collection.
  2. Select the local environment (workspace global env, or collection env).
  3. Run Auth → Sign in email, then copy better-auth.session_token from the Set-Cookie header into sessionToken.
  4. Replace sample IDs (userId, postId, groupId, …) with values from your local DB.

  Mutating requests send Origin: {{origin}} because the API CSRF check requires a localhost origin.

  GitHub Actions (bruno-api-tests.yml) runs:
    bru run --global-env ci --workspace-path .. --tags smoke,workflow,release-gate
  and injects platform_name, build_id, and commit_sha. Those tags are on unauthenticated system probes plus /api/profile/test.
}
